          "title": "You'll want to know: موج",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "موج — mauj — \"a wave; a billow\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سمندر میں اونچی موجیں ہیں۔ samandar meṅ ū̃chī maujeṅ haiṅ. There are high waves on the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "موج (mauj) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic mawj, \"waves, surging\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
